## Release binaries. The notarized zip is published as a GitHub Release asset,
## not committed: it is ~4 MB a release, and git keeps every one of them for
## ever. site/appcast.xml IS committed - it is a few KB of text and the site has
## to serve it from getsnappy.fyi.
site/*.zip

## App Store screenshot intermediates. The composed frames in
## store/screenshots/ are committed; the raw captures they are built from are
## machine- and desktop-specific and can be regenerated.
store/screenshots/raw/

